    <unit id="=&gt;q14_original" name="=&gt;q14_original">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">27</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="reviewed">
        <source>::Our team recently came across two reagents which have proven extremely toxic to all organisms which underwent artificial mutations. Preliminary results suggest that injecting any of these two reagents - which I have designated as Exitus-1 and Exitus-2 - into the Crucible - or using them on mutated organisms in any other way - will cause immediate and most likely fatal effects on exposed organisms. I have deleted the atomic sequences of both of these two reagents, deleted their entries from the current reagent cycle and stored them in a safe place. One container of each of these two reagents will be used to map and possibly predict future reagent sequences which could have negative effects.

Dr. David Gerhoff - Mutagen Tanks B, Log 473#HJ::&lt;end&gt;</source>
